Section: devel
Priority: optional
Standards-Version: 3.9.2

Package: amdrocm-vision@VP_ROCM_REL@
Version: @VP_VER@
Maintainer: ROCm Engineering <rocm-support@amd.com>
Architecture: amd64
Depends: amdrocm-mivisionx@VP_ROCM_REL@ (>= @VP_VER@), amdrocm-rocal@VP_ROCM_REL@ (>= @VP_VER@), amdrocm-roccv@VP_ROCM_REL@ (>= @VP_VER@), amdrocm-pydecode@VP_ROCM_REL@ (>= @VP_VER@)
Description: AMD ROCm Computer Vision extension pack (runtime meta-package)
 Installs MIVisionX, rocAL, rocCV, and rocPyDecode runtime libraries.
 This is a convenience meta-package — it carries no files of its own.
